BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Future Proof Your Career with AI
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261024T123000
UID:6aaac71119094f0c69389746@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The job market is changing fast\, but AI can help candidates s
 tay ahead. This session explores how to use AI as a career coach to identi
 fy skill gaps\, explore new roles\, and track industry trends.\nRegistrati
 on is required. Register here or call 416-396-8939.
LOCATION:Taylor Memorial\, Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aaac71119094f0c69389746
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
