DESCRIPTION:The lighter side of communication​! Come prepared to laugh a
 nd learn while you discover how to communicate even more effectively with 
 family and friends by understanding what the strokes of your handwriting m
 ean. Everyone will learn about their strengths as reflected in the 'paper 
 mirror' of their handwriting. Elaine will be e-mailing Handwriting Profi
 les to the Participants who fill out the Handwriting Form!
LOCATION:Riverdale\, Room 1
