 u're into slow burns\, second chances\, or enemies-to-lovers\, there's som
 ething here for every kind of romantic. Come read\, swoon\, and share your
  favorite moments with fellow book lovers.\nThe Romance Book for the Novem
 ber 4\nth\nmeeting is\nGreat Big Beautiful Life\nby Emily Henry.\nLimited 
 copies will be available in branch for pick up from October 7th.\nPlease n
 ote that this book club is for individuals 18+.\nDrop-ins welcome\, regist
 ration is optional but encouraged if you wish to receive a reminder email.
