DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261105T140000
UID:6abbcbc696ec3a003ad6f8b6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us online with\nDigital Main Street.\nSocial media is an 
 invaluable tool for today's business\, whether you are just starting out o
 r been established for years. Not understanding how to use social media ef
 fectively can leave you overwhelmed and ultimately hurt your bottom line a
 s your potential customers can easily find your competitors. This webinar 
 will discuss social media platforms\, types of content\, and best practice
 s.\nThis program is part of the Newcomer Entrepreneurship Initiative and o
 ur continued efforts to champion inclusive entrepreneurship in Toronto\, b
 y finding more ways to uplift and support the journeys of diverse entrepre
 neurial communities such as newcomer entrepreneurs\, Black entrepreneurs\,
  and women entrepreneurs. We strive to accomplish this through storytellin
 g\, shared experiences\, and open conversations that reflect the diversity
  of Toronto’s small business community.\nRegistration:\nThis virtual Zoo
 m event is free to join. Once registered\, you’ll receive an email with 
 the Zoom link.\nNeed help with Zoom?\n-\nJoining and participating in a Zo
 om webinar\n-\nZoom Privacy Statement\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe
