DESCRIPTION:Develop and exercise the skills you need to be an active parti
 cipant in everyday democracy in this fun\, interactive\n6\n0-minute\nsessi
 on.\nDemocracy Fitness expands traditional ideas of what democracy is by e
 xploring the skills that help people participate in civic life\, build con
 nection\, and work better together.\nIn this session\, we’ll exercise ou
 r\nActive Listening\nMuscle:\nIn a democracy\, everyone has the right to s
 peak. Being heard requires that someone listens. When you listen openly an
 d with curiosity\, you create understanding and trust.\nRegistration Recom
 mended. Drop-ins welcome.\nAdults only.\nThis program is offered in partne
 rship with Democracy Fitness Global and MASS LBP.\nGenerously supported by
