UID:6ad374aa2b40e729fed2bcb0@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:An expressive arts journey into receptivity\, self-trust\, and
  the creative possibilities already within us. Creativity may be closer th
 an we think. Through breathing\, painting meditation and playful expressiv
 e arts\, these four workshops invite us to slow down\, become receptive\, 
 and listen for what is emerging within us. We will experiment\, follow une
 xpected possibilities\, and discover ways of meeting the creative process 
 with curiosity and a friendly face.\nNo experience with art is required.\n
 October 29:\nExploring Paper Sculpture Techniques\nNovember 5\n: Discoveri
 ng Textures & Colours of Oil Pastels\nNovember 12:\nExperimenting in 2 & 3
 -D\nNovember 19:\nFollowing Our Own Voice\nRegistration required through t
 he Bayview Village Association. Click\nhere\nto register.
