DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T140000
UID:6abbce44035faf0033d90e2f@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us online with\nDigital Main Street.\nAs AI continues to 
 evolve\, how your business utilizes it for your online presence can also e
 volve your brand. In this webinar\, you will learn about generative AI and
  the different ways it can help your business. The webinar will discuss be
 st practices for applying it to your marketing strategies\, various AI pla
 tforms\, and the areas it can support your business.\nAttendees will walk 
 away with a solid understanding of generative AI and how to integrate it w
 ith their existing marketing plans.\nGenAI Tools being explored:\n1. Gemin
 i\n2. Gemini Notebook\n3. Nano Banana\nSession Agenda:\n1. What is Generat
 ive AI?\n2. AI & Your Daily Operations\n3. AI & Customer Support\n4. AI & 
 Marketing\n5. Best Practices for AI: Challenges with Using AI and How to M
 itigate Them\nThis program is part of the Newcomer Entrepreneurship Initia
 tive and our continued efforts to champion inclusive entrepreneurship in T
 oronto\, by finding more ways to uplift and support the journeys of divers
 e entrepreneurial communities such as newcomer entrepreneurs\, Black entre
 preneurs\, and women entrepreneurs. We strive to accomplish this through s
 torytelling\, shared experiences\, and open conversations that reflect the
  diversity of Toronto’s small business community.\nRegistration:\nThis v
 irtual Zoom event is free to join. Once registered\, you’ll receive an e
 mail with the Zoom link.\nNeed help with Zoom?\n-\nJoining and participati
 ng in a Zoom webinar\n-\nZoom Privacy Statement\nInformation Collection No
 tice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto P
 ublic Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, an
 d 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program registrat
 ion\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handles you
 r information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl.ca\n\
 , 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
