BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Democracy Fitness: Opinion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261125T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261125T190000
UID:6ad91572ad4027659154970c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Develop and exercise the skills you need to be an active parti
 cipant in everyday democracy in this fun\, interactive\n6\n0-minute\nsessi
 on.\nDemocracy Fitness expands traditional ideas of what democracy is by e
 xploring the skills that help people participate in civic life\, build con
 nection\, and work better together.\nIn this session\, we’ll exercise ou
 r\nOpinion\nMuscle:\nIn a democracy\, you have the right to your own opini
 ons. When we share them with each other\, we discover how they take shape 
 and can be challenged.\nRegistration Recommended. Drop-ins welcome.\nAdult
