DESCRIPTION:Geometric patterns are among the most recognizable visual expr
 essions of Islamic art and architecture. In the past\, craftsmen had an ex
 tensive practical knowledge of geometry. Nowadays\, we tend to rely heavil
 y on tools such as a protractors\, compasses\, and rulers. In this worksho
