UID:6ada3736f4d1423e2ce41e4c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Looking for a job but not sure where to start? Learn how to se
 arch for opportunities that match your interests\, skills\, and goals. Thi
 s workshop will explore practical job search strategies\, how to use labou
 r market information to understand hiring trends and in-demand skills\, an
 d how to identify industries and opportunities that align with your career
  goals.\nThis program is part of TPL's Career Coaches in Residence and is 
 generously supported by our lead donor Azrieli Foundation along with suppo
 rting donors Fidelity Canada\, Friends of Toronto Public Library\, South C
 hapter and The William and Nona Heaslip Foundation.\nFor more information\
 , please visit\ntpl.ca/careercoach
