 l teach you how to use a dj controller and software in a fun and relaxed a
 tmosphere. Working individually or in pairs\, you'll create and exchange p
 laylists of songs that represent meaningful moments in your life.\nNo prio
 r experience needed.\nThis 5-week program series takes place every Thursda
 y from November 12th – December 10th.\nWeeks 1 – 4: Learn DJing skills
 .\nWeek 5: Showcase! Perform your new skills for the group and your friend
 s and family. Refreshments will be provided. Ingredient list will be ava
